> f(x,y) = (x^2-y^2)/(x^2+y^2)
> limit f(x,0) x->0
limit of x^2/x^2 as x -> 0:
  0/0: L'Hôpital: lim (2x)/(2x) = lim 1
  = 1 (from both sides)
  numeric from the left (a - h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1
