limit of (x^2 - (x^2)^2)/(x^2 + (x^2)^2) as x -> 0:
  0/0: L'Hôpital: lim (2x - 4x^3)/(2x + 4x^3) = lim (2x - 4x^3)/(2x + 4x^3)
  0/0: L'Hôpital: lim (2 - 12x^2)/(12x^2 + 2) = lim (2 - 12x^2)/(12x^2 + 2)
  = 1 (from both sides)
