> limit f(x,1/x) x->0
limit of (x^2 - (1/x)^2)/(x^2 + (1/x)^2) as x -> 0:
  1/x -> inf (the numerator -> 1, x -> 0+)
  inf/inf: L'Hôpital: lim (2/x^3 + 2x)/(-2/x^3 + 2x) = lim 2/(x^3*(-2/x^3 + 2x)) + 2x/(-2/x^3 + 2x)
  -2/x^3 -> -inf (the numerator -> -2, x^3 -> 0+)
  0*inf: x^3*-2/x^3 + 2x = (-2/x^3 + 2x)/(1/x^3)
  inf/inf: L'Hôpital: lim (6x^2/x^6 + 2)/(-3x^2/x^6) = lim -2 - 2x^4/3
  = -1 (from both sides)
  numeric from the left (a - h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): -0.99980002, -0.9999999969, -1, -1, -1, -1
    extrapolated (Richardson): -1 (estimated error 0): agrees
  numeric from the right (a + h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): -0.99980002, -0.9999999969, -1, -1, -1, -1
    extrapolated (Richardson): -1 (estimated error 0): agrees
